              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "detail",
              "label": null,
              "text": "盲點象限：自己不知道，他人知道",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "detail",
              "label": null,
              "text": "潛能象限：自己、他人都不知道",
